rooms_desc ({"You are in Loverboy's house.The walls and floors are made of clouds, you feel like in the 7th heaven.This room is filled with passion, peace and love.You can see the sun shining through the window, it makes your heart feel free.There is a strange looking chair in the corner.You can also see a figure standing next to the window, who is it?In the middle of the room you can see a fountain.","This is Loverboy's swimming-poolYou can see a swimming-pool in the middel of the roomThe water seems to be warmThe pool is made in the shape of a heartYou feel like swimming",0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
